From edff95b105b05faca02461d48f6a81d175a54614 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TB378FC Maintainer <maintainer@tb378fc.local>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:47:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Input: lenovo_pogo_keyboard: add TB378FC magnetic pogo
 keyboard support

Add mainline serdev keyboard and multitouch touchpad support for the
Lenovo Xiaoxin Pad Pro GT 13 (TB378FC) magnetic pogo-pin keyboard folio
on QUPv3 WRAP1 SE2 (0xa88000, 921600 8N1):

- tty: serial: qcom_geni_serial: support optional half-duplex tx-en-gpios
  with configurable qcom,tx-en-delay-us settle delay before TX DMA/FIFO
  transfers and immediate RX switchback upon transfer completion
- Input: lenovo_pogo_keyboard: add clean-room serdev driver implementing
  PPP-escaped framing, 64-byte rotating XOR scrambling, 6KRO HID keyboard,
  consumer media/brightness keys, 4-slot INPUT_MT_POINTER buttonpad with
  palm rejection, LED/FnLock sync, Hall hotplug, and drm_panel_follower
- arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750-lenovo-tb378fc: enable uart2 (serial@a88000)
  with 450 us tx-en-gpios (gpio29) and lenovo,tb378fc-pogo-keyboard child
- dt-bindings: document tx-en-gpios and lenovo,tb378fc-pogo-keyboard

Signed-off-by: TB378FC Maintainer <maintainer@tb378fc.local>
---
